| **Orion O6N** | same, **SPI soldered down** | `no data` | **Requires physically removing the soldered chip** | `no data` |
| **E52C** | eMMC + SD (SD preferred when present) | ✅ **Built-in CH340 on a dedicated USB-C port** | Maskrom pinhole; USB-A **needs an A-to-A cable** | `no data` |
